            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery spasm after off-pump coronary artery by-pass grafting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>830-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The immediate postoperative period of patients undergoing off-pump coronary artery by-pass grafting can be severely complicated by unsuspected coronary artery spasm. A case of right coronary artery spasm possibly induced by myocardial stabilisation technique is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
